  },
  {
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "id": "rules_body",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1762,
   "y": 1345,
   "width": 509,
   "height": 114,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "text": "- dates: resolving \"next Monday\", lateness\n- who waits: request allocation by due date\n- limits: 48h between chases, at most 2\n- OpenBoxes checks before any write\n\nSame input, same result. Every write traces\nto a record and a supplier's exact words.",
   "originalText": "- dates: resolving \"next Monday\", lateness\n- who waits: request allocation by due date\n- limits: 48h between chases, at most 2\n- OpenBoxes checks before any write\n\nSame input, same result. Every write traces\nto a record and a supplier's exact words.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "id": "model_guard",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1575,
   "width": 2250,
   "height": 19,
   "strokeColor": "#6d28d9",
   "text": "Code checks every model output: a quote must appear in the message, a choice must come from a fixed list, low confidence goes to a person, and no model writes to OpenBoxes directly.",
