   "id": "tagline",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1715,
   "width": 2250,
   "height": 28,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "text": "Rules make it safe and repeatable. Models let it read, judge and write. A case closes only when the goods are in and nobody waiting is short.",
